cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "CZI Brightfield Stitching: batch stitching of Zeiss CZI brightfield tile scans into OME-TIFF"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Tiaan
    family-names: JvR
  - given-names: Isabella
    family-names: Lohse
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-29
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/tiaanjvr/czi-brightfield-stitching"
abstract: >-
  A Python and Fiji pipeline that batch-stitches Zeiss .czi brightfield
  mosaic scans into tiled, compressed OME-TIFF files with physical pixel
  sizes, including flat-field illumination correction, followed by a QuPath
  script for dual-threshold tissue masking.
keywords:
  - microscopy
  - image stitching
  - brightfield
  - histology
  - CZI
  - OME-TIFF
  - Fiji
  - QuPath
